From d5bbf9601fcd965d438049941f48670e338a4de0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seb <sebastian.merz@web.de>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 21:43:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add LMS-faithful synchronisation support

- map player jiffies to server time with a min-latency estimator
  (track_jiffies_epoch / jiffies_to_timestamp), ported from Lyrion Music Server
- expose play points (status_time + apparent stream start) per player
- start_at(): coordinated start at a common player-clock instant (strm u)
- SyncGroup.start()/check(): ports of StreamingController::_syncStart/_CheckSync
- per-player sync prefs (start/play delay, min_sync_adjust, maintain_sync)
- tests: tests/sync_test.py
---
